                  "text": "u[n] = b u[n\u22121] + K (e[n] \u2212 a e[n\u22121]).\nTwo explicit memories, no actuator limiter. Gains a,b,K enter as signals.\nThis instance is drawn here; its reusable definition is in schema_elements.s7library.",
